\\\"\\n  - paragraph: 瞬态工程里，负载与一次侧进水温度的变化在时间条上给冷板功耗 / 一次侧进水温度打关键帧\\n  - generic: 泵控制\\n  - generic: 控制方式\\n  - combobox \\\"控制方式\\\" [disabled]:\\n    - option \\\"固定转速\\\" [selected]\\n    - option \\\"冷板温度 PI\\\"\\n    - option \\\"泵压差 PI\\\"\\n  - paragraph: 保存的泵速与阀位轨迹是基线；下方在线设定从下一接受步生效。此入口不接 PI 控制器。\\n  - paragraph: 实验设置随工程保存。参数包：liquid-demo-equipment · mock-1-dae-v3\\n- generic: 播放速度\\n- combobox \\\"播放速度\\\":\\n  - option \\\"1×\\\"\\n  - option \\\"10×\\\"\\n  - option \\\"最快计算\\\" [selected]\\n- button \\\"导出液冷运行文件\\\"\\n- button \\\"新建实验\\\"\\n- group \\\"当前运行的计划负载倍率\\\":\\n  - generic: 当前运行的计划负载倍率\\n  - button \\\"80%（−20%）\\\" [disabled]: 80%\\n  - button \\\"100%\\\" [disabled]\\n  - button \\\"120%（+20%）\\\" [disabled]: 120%\\n  - paragraph: 已接受负载倍率：100%。\\n  - paragraph: 在线倍率与工程预设的负载计划相乘，例如 1.2 × 1.2 = 1.44；已接受历史保持完整。\\n  - generic: 泵\\n  - combobox \\\"泵\\\":\\n    - option \\\"m_30_pump\\\" [selected]\\n  - generic: 泵相对转速\\n  - spinbutton \\\"泵相对转速\\\": \\\"1\\\"\\n  - button \\\"排队泵速\\\" [disabled]\\n  - paragraph: 当前已接受：m_30_pump = 1\\n  - generic: 阀门\\n  - combobox \\\"阀门\\\":\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059294098\\\" [selected]\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059300037\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059304833\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059309112\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059313540\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059317045\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059321377\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059326858\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059337713\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059365363\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059369370\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059372094\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059375012\\\"\\n    - option \\\"m_32_control_valve_1778059381648\\\"\\n  - generic: 阀门开度\\n  - spinbutton \\\"阀门开度\\\": \\\"1\\\"\\n  - button \\\"排队阀位\\\" [disa